   "intent": "thick, moving bass from two detuned saws.",
   "code": "$: stack(\n  note(\"c2 c2 eb2 g1\").s(\"sawtooth\"),\n  note(\"c2 c2 eb2 g1\").s(\"sawtooth\").add(note(0.12))\n).lpf(400).lpq(8).gain(0.6)",
